<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="07">
<name>Steering</name>
<section id="1000U_S0017" variety="S0017">
<name>Steering Column</name>
<ttl id="1000U_S0017_745FR_T00AZ" variety="T00AZ">
<name>Electric Power Steering System</name>
<para id="RM0000004TE00JX" category="C" type-id="300E6" name-id="480Y1-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C1516/16</dtccode>
<dtcname>Torque Sensor 0 Point Calibration Incomplete</dtcname>
<dtccode>C1526/18</dtccode>
<dtcname>Rotation Angle Sensor Output Calibration Incomplete</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000004TE00JX_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00005XG00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The power steering computer assembly outputs this DTC when it determines that the torque sensor 0 point calibration or rotation angle sensor output calibration is incomplete.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.58in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Action</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1516/16</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Torque sensor 0 point calibration was not performed correctly, for example because the steering wheel was touched</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>After clearing the DTCs and sensor calibration values, perform the torque sensor 0 point calibration; if no DTC is output, there is no malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1526/18</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Rotation angle sensor output calibration was not performed correctly</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>After clearing the DTCs and sensor calibration values, perform the rotation angle sensor output calibration; if no DTC is output, there is no malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000004TE00JX_02" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00005XH00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>When replacing the steering column assembly, perform the torque sensor 0 point calibration and rotation angle sensor output calibration. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000024YB004X"/>)</ptxt>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000004TE00JX_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00005XI00000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the procedure, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000URU00GX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0002" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___00005XJ00000">
<testtitle>Torque Sensor 0 Point Calibration and Rotation Angle Sensor Output Calibration</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the procedure, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000024YB004X"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0003" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00005XK00000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck the DTC. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000URU00GX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="5.47in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.61in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Malfunction code is output even after performing the torque sensor 0 point calibration and rotation angle sensor output calibration 3 times</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Malfunction code is output even after performing the torque sensor 0 point calibration and rotation angle sensor output calibration 1 or 2 times</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Normal code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If a DTC is still output after performing the torque sensor 0 point calibration and rotation angle sensor output calibration 3 times, replace the power steering computer assembly.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0004" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0001" fin="false">B</right>
<right ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0009" fin="true">C</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A3H00000">
<testtitle>Replace Power Steering Computer Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the procedure, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000UNH00TX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0005" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___00005XL00000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the procedure, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000URU00GX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0006" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___00005XM00000">
<testtitle>Torque Sensor 0 Point Calibration and Rotation Angle Sensor Output Calibration</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the procedure, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000024YB004X"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0007" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0007" proc-id="RM0550J___00005XN00000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck the DTC. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000URU00GX"/>)</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="5.47in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.61in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Malfunction code is output even after performing the torque sensor 0 point calibration and rotation angle sensor output calibration 3 times</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Malfunction code is output even after performing the torque sensor 0 point calibration and rotation angle sensor output calibration 1 or 2 times</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Normal code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If a DTC is still output after performing the torque sensor 0 point calibration and rotation angle sensor output calibration 3 times, replace the steering column assembly.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0008" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0005" fin="false">B</right>
<right ref="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0010" fin="true">C</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0008">
<testtitle>Replace Steering Column Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000UCZ00QX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0009">
<testtitle>No problem (returned to normal after calibration completed)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000004TE00JX_03_0010">
<testtitle>Complete</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>